{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "40da69a3-50cf-825c-a615-5c96a401704f",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T14:48:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Hector Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:46:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. How may I assist you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:46:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, sorry, I know this is probably a silly question. I just got a property tax bill in the mail, and my mortgage company is supposed to pay that out of escrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:46:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. May I have the property address, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:46:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, yeah. It's 57 Wellington Avenue. Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:46:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr.... and your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:46:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cordero. Hector Cordero. Sorry, I should've said that first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:47:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's quite all right. One moment while I pull up the account. [pause] I do see a bill issued for this parcel. The most recent quarterly installment shows as unpaid at this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:47:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Unpaid. Okay. Sorry, but that's the thing, it should've gone out from the escrow account already. I get a statement every year saying they pay it. So now I've got a bill with my name on it and I'm not thrilled about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:47:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Our records show no payment received from a mortgage servicer for this installment. Do you know whether they have a different parcel or account number on file?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:47:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't, sorry. I'd have to dig through the papers. [pause] Sorry, hang on, that's the other phone ringing in the house. Somebody'll get it. Anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:47:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:47:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. What I need is a payoff figure, like the total owed through the end of this month, January thirty-first. Then I can hand that to the mortgage company and make them deal with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:47:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. Through January thirty-first, I can give you the amount due including any interest accrued to that date. One moment. [pause] I can have that figure written up and sent to you, or I can read it to you now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:48:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, can you read it? And then maybe send it too, so I've got something in writing for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:48:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. I'll read it now and also send a written statement to the address on file. Do you have a pen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:48:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, go ahead. Sorry, the phone's still ringing back there. Okay, I'm ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:48:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The statement will show the full amount through the thirty-first. Please give me a moment to finalize the interest calculation so that I read you the correct number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T14:48:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Sorry for the hassle. I know it's not your fault, it's just annoying."
    }
  ],
